    "question": {
      ":question/id": "22845a53-1add-53c4-9114-54ec03d96896",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x-90^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=90^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x-90^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 90^\\circ+\\sin x\\sin 90^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(0\\right)+\\sin x\\left(1\\right)\\\\\n&=\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "df32816a-8787-51ee-9550-fa5e3c9e5bcd",
